# Creating project <projectAlias> for user <userAlias>
* generating net-new project details <projectAlias> for user <userAlias>
* clicking on "[data-testid='nav-list-projects']"
* waiting for "[data-testid='list-projects-page']" to appear
* clicking on text "New"
* typing stored user <userAlias> project <projectAlias> field "name" in "input[placeholder*='Enter project name']"
* typing stored user <userAlias> project <projectAlias> field "code" in "[data-testid='project-code-input']"
* typing stored user <userAlias> project <projectAlias> field "description" in "textarea[placeholder*='Enter project description']"
* clicking button with text "Create Project"
* waiting for "[data-testid='create-project-dialog']" to disappear
* verifying stored user <userAlias> project <projectAlias> field "name" is visible in "[data-testid='project-list']"

